      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Transportation Pihani UP30 Hardoi</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
<p>When transporting a car from one location to another, especially internationally, it is essential to have the required documents in order to ensure a smooth and hassle-free experience. In Pihani, these essential paperwork requirements include:</p>

<h3>Vehicle Registration Certificate (RC) Photocopy:</h3>
<p>The RC is a legal document that serves as proof of ownership of the vehicle. Transporting the RC photocopy ensures that authorities can verify the ownership of the car and prevent any possible tampering or theft during transportation.</p>

<h3>Current Pollution Control Certificate (PUC):</h3>
<p>The PUC is a document that confirms that the vehicle meets environmental standards and is emission-compliant. Transporting the current PUC ensures that the car meets local regulations upon arrival at the destination.</p>

<h3>Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
<p>Insurance is crucial for protecting both the vehicle and the transport company. A valid insurance certificate provides coverage in case of any accident or damage during transportation. Make sure to confirm the coverage details with the transport company beforehand.</p>

<h3>IBA-Approved Consignment Bill of Lading:</h3>
<p>The International Bill of Lading (IBA) is an important document that serves as a contract between the transport company and the vehicle owner. It outlines the details of the transportation, including the pick-up and drop-off locations, vehicle description, and insurance coverage. Ensure to obtain an IBA-approved consignment bill of lading from a reliable transportation company.</p>

<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance:</h3>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">To ensure maximum protection for your car during transportation, it is advisable to opt for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance.</p>
